<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1333199955"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1445725434"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="This Feeling"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="The Chainsmokers / Kelsea Ballerini"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Sick Boy"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:10.530"><div begin="00:08.116" end="03:10.530"><p begin="00:08.116" end="00:10.280" itunes:key="L52477">I'll tell you a story<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我要为你讲述一个故事 在它变成事实以前</span></p><p begin="00:10.290" end="00:12.350" itunes:key="L52478">Before it tells itself</p><p begin="00:12.360" end="00:14.710" itunes:key="L52479">I'll lay out all my reasons<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会说明我的理由 你可能会说我脑子进水</span></p><p begin="00:14.720" end="00:17.050" itunes:key="L52480">You say that I need help</p><p begin="00:17.060" end="00:19.450" itunes:key="L52481">We all got expectations<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们都各自向往 但往往事与愿违</span></p><p begin="00:19.460" end="00:21.540" itunes:key="L52482">And sometimes they go wrong</p><p begin="00:21.550" end="00:23.540" itunes:key="L52483">But no one listens to me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没人倾听我的想法 所以我心事写进歌里</span></p><p begin="00:23.550" end="00:26.280" itunes:key="L52484">So I put it in this song</p><p begin="00:26.746" end="00:29.320" itunes:key="L52485">They tell me think with my head<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们说我该动动脑子 而不是意气用事</span></p><p begin="00:29.330" end="00:31.400" itunes:key="L52486">Not that thing in my chest</p><p begin="00:31.410" end="00:35.420" itunes:key="L52487">They got their hands at my neck this time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这一次 他们想要掐灭我冲动的欲火</span></p><p begin="00:35.830" end="00:38.540" itunes:key="L52488">But you're the one that I want<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但你就是我心仪的那个 即便这真的错的离谱</span></p><p begin="00:38.550" end="00:40.540" itunes:key="L52489">If that's really so wrong</p><p begin="00:40.550" end="00:44.690" itunes:key="L52490">Then they don't know what this feeling is like<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那他们一定不懂我此刻的感受</span></p><p begin="00:45.090" end="00:47.560" itunes:key="L52491">And I say, "Yeah"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我说 对对对</span></p><p begin="00:47.570" end="00:49.880" itunes:key="L52492">Yeah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好吧</span></p><p begin="00:50.280" end="00:52.100" itunes:key="L52493">Yeah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无所谓的</span></p><p begin="00:52.110" end="00:54.550" itunes:key="L52494">Yeah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好吧</span></p><p begin="00:54.160" end="00:56.840" itunes:key="L52495">(And I say, "Yeah")<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我说 对对对</span></p><p begin="00:56.850" end="00:59.080" itunes:key="L52496">(Yeah)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无所谓的</span></p><p begin="00:59.635" end="01:01.380" itunes:key="L52497">(Yeah)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好吧</span></p><p begin="01:01.908" end="01:03.540" itunes:key="L52498">(Yeah)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你们说的都对</span></p><p begin="01:02.940" end="01:04.760" itunes:key="L52499">I'll tell them my story<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我向他们讲述一个故事 他们坐下来听点头称是</span></p><p begin="01:04.970" end="01:07.140" itunes:key="L52500">They'll sit and nod their heads</p><p begin="01:07.450" end="01:09.560" itunes:key="L52501">I tell you all my secrets<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我所有秘密都只分享给你 你却都告诉你的朋友们</span></p><p begin="01:09.570" end="01:11.670" itunes:key="L52502">And you tell all your friends</p><p begin="01:11.680" end="01:14.290" itunes:key="L52503">Hold on to your opinions<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你应该坚持你的想法 坚持你的说法</span></p><p begin="01:14.300" end="01:16.430" itunes:key="L52504">And stand by what you say</p><p begin="01:16.440" end="01:18.450" itunes:key="L52505">In the end it's my decision<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">坚持你的说法</span></p><p begin="01:18.460" end="01:20.990" itunes:key="L52506">So it's my fault when it ends</p><p begin="01:21.600" end="01:24.220" itunes:key="L52507">They tell me think with my head<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们说我该动动脑子 而不是意气用事</span></p><p begin="01:24.230" end="01:26.300" itunes:key="L52508">Not that thing in my chest</p><p begin="01:26.310" end="01:30.180" itunes:key="L52509">They got their hands at my neck this time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这一次 他们想要掐灭我冲动的欲火</span></p><p begin="01:30.600" end="01:33.330" itunes:key="L52510">But you're the one that I want<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但你就是我心仪的那个 即便这真的错的离谱</span></p><p begin="01:33.340" end="01:35.400" itunes:key="L52511">If that's really so wrong</p><p begin="01:35.410" end="01:39.160" itunes:key="L52512">Then they don't know what this feeling is like<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那他们一定不懂我此刻的感受</span></p><p begin="01:39.833" end="01:42.530" itunes:key="L52513">(And I say, "Yeah")<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我说 对对对</span></p><p begin="01:42.540" end="01:44.840" itunes:key="L52514">(Yeah)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好吧</span></p><p begin="01:45.343" end="01:47.070" itunes:key="L52515">(Yeah)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无所谓的</span></p><p begin="01:47.080" end="01:49.050" itunes:key="L52516">(Yeah)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好吧</span></p><p begin="01:49.060" end="01:51.480" itunes:key="L52517">(And I say, "Yeah")<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我说 对对对</span></p><p begin="01:51.490" end="01:54.140" itunes:key="L52518">(Yeah)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无所谓的</span></p><p begin="01:54.550" end="01:56.010" itunes:key="L52519">(Yeah)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好吧</span></p><p begin="01:56.020" end="01:58.490" itunes:key="L52520">(Yeah)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你们说的都对</span></p><p begin="01:57.790" end="01:59.950" itunes:key="L52521">I'll tell you a story<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我要为你讲述一个故事在它变成事实以前</span></p><p begin="01:59.960" end="02:02.190" itunes:key="L52522">Before it tells itself</p><p begin="02:02.200" end="02:04.510" itunes:key="L52523">I'll lay out all my reasons<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会说明我的理由 你可能会说我脑子进水</span></p><p begin="02:04.520" end="02:06.620" itunes:key="L52524">You'll say that I need help</p><p begin="02:06.630" end="02:09.240" itunes:key="L52525">We all got expectations<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们都各自向往 但往往事与愿违</span></p><p begin="02:09.250" end="02:11.360" itunes:key="L52526">And sometimes they go wrong</p><p begin="02:11.370" end="02:13.240" itunes:key="L52527">But no one listens to me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没人倾听我的想法 所以我心事写进歌里</span></p><p begin="02:13.250" end="02:15.750" itunes:key="L52528">So I put it in this song</p><p begin="02:16.450" end="02:18.970" itunes:key="L52529">They tell me think with my head<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们说我该动动脑子 而不是意气用事</span></p><p begin="02:18.990" end="02:21.070" itunes:key="L52530">Not that thing in my chest</p><p begin="02:21.080" end="02:25.130" itunes:key="L52531">They got their hands at my neck this time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这一次 他们想要掐灭我冲动的欲火</span></p><p begin="02:25.430" end="02:28.210" itunes:key="L52532">But you're the one that I want<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但你就是我心仪的那个 即便这真的错的离谱</span></p><p begin="02:28.220" end="02:30.290" itunes:key="L52533">If that's really so wrong</p><p begin="02:30.300" end="02:34.360" itunes:key="L52534">Then they don't know what this feeling is like<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那他们一定不懂我此刻的感受</span></p><p begin="02:34.370" end="02:37.270" itunes:key="L52535">My friends say, "No"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的朋友都说 不不不</span></p><p begin="02:37.280" end="02:41.090" itunes:key="L52536">No (But they don't know)</p><p begin="02:40.090" end="02:41.850" itunes:key="L52537">No<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但他们根本不懂</span></p><p begin="02:41.860" end="02:43.950" itunes:key="L52538">No<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">根本不懂</span></p><p begin="02:44.585" end="02:46.310" itunes:key="L52539">No<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是的 他们根本不懂</span></p><p begin="02:46.320" end="02:50.260" itunes:key="L52540">No (They don't know)</p><p begin="02:49.260" end="02:51.880" itunes:key="L52541">No (No, no)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们根本不懂</span></p><p begin="02:50.950" end="02:52.833" itunes:key="L52542">No<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">根本不懂</span></p><p begin="02:52.843" end="03:00.521" itunes:key="L52543">(And I say yeah)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要再说了</span></p><p begin="03:02.069" end="03:07.216" itunes:key="L52544">And I say yeah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我说 不要再说了</span></p><p begin="03:07.287" end="03:10.530" itunes:key="L52545">They don't know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们不懂我的感受</span></p></div></body></tt>